      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed 100%. My issue is that I can't even see that it's rated Very Poor at all when I have avatars hidden by trust rank in order to save some frames. It just says blocked, with no details about what's actually being blocked. I used to just show avatars individually in places with a lot of avatars, usually avoiding showing Very Poor avatars in excess. But now that I can't even see the quality rating or the stats, I have to be insanely careful about showing avatars at all in any instance.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
