      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is very sad seeing it fully hidden now, when you ask how big are their avatars, you get only \"it's optimized\" or \"It's not big\", nobody says exact number that lets you decide if it's a good idea to kill your game to see their avatars or keep it mysterious.\nI hate this ugly horrible idea of a new feature. I was expecting it to be this bad, but it's just so.. horrible idea!!!!\nI want to tell ppl I can't show their avatars because it's 60+mb, not asking how big their avatars and get vague answers.\nAvatar stats needs a fix, a real fix, not hiding the slightly very poor with the extremely poor ones. I don't want to be constantly crashing because I NEED to keep everyone shown to see their avatars ONLY. OR HAVE THE SAFETY MANAGES IT AND FAILS 99% of the times crashing me, no PC is good enough, avatars are crashy big with no HARD LIMITS.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
